                <pb facs="0841" n="721" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg721"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Minister Magoon.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-12-18"><hi rendition="#italic">December 18,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Root instructs Mr. Magoon that Department’s instruction No. 19 of the 4th
                    instant may be communicated to the directorate of the Liberal party as answer to
                    their memorial.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
